<title>MEXICO: TMM places $200 mln in Yankee bonds.</title>
<headline>TMM places $200 mln in Yankee bonds.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican shipping company Transportacion Maritima Mexicana SA de CV (TMM) on Thursday said it placed $200 million in Yankee bonds via the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>TMM made the announcement in a statement released through the Mexican Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((--Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9562))</p>
